---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-peach">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-forest">Le Cuistologue</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Des repas préparés directement chez vous, à partir de produits de
          saison, pour retrouver le plaisir de bien manger sans passer des
          heures en cuisine.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex gap-3">
          <a
            href="#"
            aria-label="Instagram"
            class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-forest/10 text-forest transition-colors hover:bg-forest hover:text-cream"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" />
              <circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r="1" fill="currentColor" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#"
            aria-label="Facebook"
            class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-forest/10 text-forest transition-colors hover:bg-forest hover:text-cream"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                d="M14 9h2V6h-2c-1.7 0-3 1.3-3 3v2H9v3h2v6h3v-6h2l1-3h-3V9c0-.4.4-.8 1-.8Z"
                fill="currentColor"
              />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-forest">Navigation</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-forest">Accueil</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#comment-ca-marche" class="hover:text-forest">Comment ça marche ?</a></li>
          <li><a href="/formules" class="hover:text-forest">Formules</a></li>
          <li><a href="/a-propos" class="hover:text-forest">À propos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/avance-immediate" class="hover:text-forest">Avance immédiate</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq" class="hover:text-forest">FAQ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-forest">Conditions</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-forest">Mentions légales</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-forest">Politique de confidentialité</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-forest">CGV</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-forest">Cookies</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-forest">Contact</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">
          <li><a href="tel:0101020304" class="hover:text-forest">01 01 02 03 04</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:contact@lecuistologue.fr" class="hover:text-forest">contact@lecuistologue.fr</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-ink/10 pt-6 text-xs text-ink-soft md:flex-row">
      <p>© {currentYear} Le Cuistologue. Tous droits réservés.</p>
      <p>Fait avec ♥</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
